# Run outputs are the research record and are committed. The whole folder is
# about 2 MB, and a result that is not in version control cannot be cited.
#
# This file previously contained "*", which silently excluded every new run.
# The primary RQ1 run went missing that way and was only found when the
# repository was checked against Assessment 2's claim of seven directories.
# Files already tracked kept being tracked, so nothing looked wrong.
#
# Guard against genuinely large binary artefacts only.
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.parquet
*.h5
*.pt